      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That would be nice to have such a feature implemented. Though uncommon, I have seen people cheat using such systems to get a better advantage against others. And although kicking them from an instance is a good short-term solution, blacklisting certain avatar components on a world would be much more ideal.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
